00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,000
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Shirley went to the mall with her friends.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,840
They walk in.

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,240
There are so many stores.

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,620
They first go to a candle shop.

5
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:14,200
The shop is having a huge sale.

6
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:18,080
Shirley picks up a green candle and smells

7
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:18,380
it.

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,760
It smells like a pine cone forest.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,960
It reminds her of her grandfather.

10
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,840
He passed away two years ago.

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,299
She feels that she should visit him.

12
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,200
She decides to buy the candle.

13
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,720
Shirley drops her friends off at their houses.

14
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,400
She drives to the cemetery.

15
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:44,460
She puts the candle on her grandfather's tombstone.

16
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,560
She smiles.

17
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,900
He would like the candle.

18
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,700
She drives back home.
